Here's what it would take to make it look like a **real fishing game**:

---

## The Gap: CSS vs Game Art

| Current (CSS) | Goal (Phaser + Art) |
|---------------|---------------------|
| Red circle bobber | Animated bobber sprite bobbing on waves |
| Gradient background | Scenic lake/dock with parallax layers |
| Static "water" | Animated water surface with ripples |
| Invisible fish | Fish shadows swimming, visible before they bite |
| CSS progress bars | Stylized UI with fishing theme |
| Line = 3px div | Curved physics-based line from rod to bobber |

---

## What You'd Need

### 1. Art Assets (The Real Work)

