## Visual Layers (Bottom to Top)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│  Steam particles (three-nebula) │  ← rises from surface
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│  Bubble particles               │  ← pop at surface
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│  Liquid surface (ripple shader) │  ← interactive, color shifts
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│  3D Cauldron model              │  ← loaded .glb
